hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"501","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Muaz bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe, Yaman ki taraf haakim kar ke, bheja to farmaya: Tum kuch ahl-e-kitab logon se milo ge to un ko us baat ki gawahi ki taraf bulana ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood-e-barhaq nahi aur main, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Allah ka bheja hua hun, agar wo us ko maan lein to un ko ye baat batlana ke Allah ne har din raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain. Agar wo us baat ko maan lein to un ko ye baat batlana ke Allah Taala ne un par zakaat farz ki hai, jo un ke maaldaaron se le kar phir unhi ke faqiron aur mohtajon ko di jaye gi. Agar wo us baat ko maan lein to aagaah raho ke un ke umda maal na lena, yani zakaat mein mutawassit janwar lena, umda doodh wala aur pur gosht farba chhaant kar na lena, aur mazloom ki baddua se bachna kyunke mazloom ki baddua aur Allah ke darmiyan koi rok nahi. (Muslim)"
"502","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghalla aur khajoor mein zakaat nahi jab tak ke paanch wasq, bees man, tak na ho aur na paanch oonton se kam mein zakaat hai aur na paanch ooqiya, 52.50 tolay, se kam chaandi mein zakaat hai. (Muslim)"
"503","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jis, khait, mein nehron aur barish, ke zariye, se pani diya jaye us mein ushr, yani daswan hissa, zakaat hai aur jo oont laga kar seenchi jaye us mein nisf-ul-ushr, yani beeswan hissa zakaat, farz hai. (Muslim)"
"504","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke ghulam aur ghoray par zakaat, farz, nahi. (Muslim)"
"505","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ko zakaat wasool karnay ko bheja. Phir Aap ko bataya gaya ke Ibn Jameel, Khalid bin Waleed aur, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chacha, Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma), in logon ne zakaat nahi di to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ibn Jameel to us ka badla leta hai ke wo mohtaaj tha aur Allah ne us ko ameer kar diya aur Khalid (raziyallahu anhu) par tum ziyadati kartay ho is liye ke us ne to zirahein aur hathiyar tak Allah ki raah mein de diye hain, yani phir zakaat kyun na de ga, aur rahay Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) to un ki zakaat aur itni hi miqdaar aur mere zimmay hai. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Umar (raziyallahu anhu)! Kya tum nahi jantay ke chacha to baap ke barabar hai. (Muslim)"
"506","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Kaaba ke saya mein baithay hue thay ke main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khidmat mein haazir hua. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe dekha to farmaya ke Rab-e-Kaaba ki qasam wohi nuqsan walay hain. Tab main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aa kar baith gaya aur na thehar saka ke khara ho gaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Mere maan baap Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par fida hon, wo kaun, log, hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo bohat maal walay hain. Magar jis ne kharch kiya idhar aur udhar aur jidhar munasib hua aur diya aagay se aur peechay se aur daahnay aur baayein se aur aisay log thoray hain. Yani jahan deen ki taeed aur Allah aur Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki marzi dekhi wahan bila takalluf kharch kiya. Aur jo oont, gaaye aur bakri wala un ki zakaat nahi deta to qayamat ke din wo janwar, jaisay duniya mein thay us se zyada motay aur charbeelay ho kar aayein ge aur apne seengon se us ko maarein ge, aur apne khuron se us ko raundein ge. Jab un janwaron mein sab se pichla guzar jaye ga to aagay wala phir us par aa jaye ga. Aur jab tak bandon ka faisla na ho jaye, us ko yehi azaab hota rahay ga. (Muslim). (Lam ataqarra se murad thehar na saka hai.)"
"507","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi chaandi ya sonay ka maalik aisa nahi ke us ki zakaat na deta ho magar wo qayamat ke din aisa ho ga ke us ke liye aag ki chataanon ke part banaye jayein ge aur wo jahannam ki aag mein garam kiye jayein ge jis se us ki peshani, pehlu aur peeth daaghi jaye gi. Jab wo thanday ho jayein ge to phir garam kiye jayein ge. Us waqt jabke din pachaas hazaar baras ke barabar hai, bandon ka faisla honay tak us ko yehi azaab ho ga aur yahan tak ke us ki raah jannat ya dozakh ki taraf niklay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya gaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Phir oont, walon, ka kya haal ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo oont wala apne oonton ka haq nahi deta aur us ke haq mein se aik ye bhi hai ke doodh doh kar ghareebon ko bhi pilaye jis din un ko pani pilaye, Arab ka mamool tha ke teesray ya chauthay din oonton ko pani pilanay le jatay wahan miskeen jama rehtay oonton ke maalik un ko doodh doh kar pilatay halanke ye wajib nahi hai magar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne oonton ka aik haq us ko bhi qarar diya hai. Jab qayamat ka din ho ga to wo aik hamwaar zameen par aundha litaya jaye ga aur wo oont nihayat farba ho kar aayein ge ke un mein se koi bacha bhi baaqi na rahay ga aur us ko apne khuron se raundein ge aur munh se kaatein ge. Phir jab un ka pehla janwar raundta chala jaye ga to pichla aa jaye ga. Yunhi sada azaab hota rahay ga saara din jo ke pachaas hazaar baras ka ho ga yahan tak ke bandon ka faisla ho jaye aur phir us ki jannat ya dozakh ki taraf kuch raah niklay. Phir arz kiya gaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Gaaye bakri ka kya haal ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi gaaye bakri wala aisa nahi jo us ki zakaat na deta ho magar jab qayamat ka din ho ga to wo aik hamwaar zameen par aundha litaya jaye ga aur un gaaye bakriyon mein se sab aayein gi, koi baaqi na rahay gi aur aisi hon gi ke un mein seeng mari hui na hon gi na be seeng aur na tootay hue seengon wali aur aa kar us ko apne seengon se maarein gi aur apne khuron se raundein gi. Jab agli us par se guzar jaye gi to pichli phir aaye gi, yehi azaab us ko pachaas hazaar baras ke saaray din mein hota rahay ga yahan tak ke bandon ka faisla ho jaye aur phir jannat ya dozakh ki taraf us ki koi raah niklay. Phir arz kiya gaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Aur ghoray? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ghoray teen tarah ke hain aik apne maalik par baar, yani wabaal, hai, doosra apne maalik ka aib dhaanpnay wala hai aur teesra apne maalik ke liye sawab ka samaan hai. Ab us wabaal walay ghoray ka haal suno jo is liye baandha gaya hai ke logon ko dikhaye aur logon mein barhkein maaray aur Musalmanon se adawat karay, so ye apne maalik ke haq mein wabaal hai. Aur wo jo aib dhaanpnay wala hai wo ghora hai ke us ko Allah ki raah mein baandha hai, yani jihad ke liye, aur us ki sawaari mein Allah ka haq nahi bhoolta aur na us ke ghaas chaara mein kami karta hai, to wo us ka aib dhaanpnay wala hai. Aur jo sawab ka samaan hai us ka kya kehna ke wo ghora hai jo Allah ki raah mein aur ahl-e-Islam ki madad aur himayat ke liye kisi charagaah ya baagh mein baandha gaya hai. Phir us ne us charagaah ya baagh se jo khaya us ki ginti ke muwafiq nekiyan us ke maalik ke liye likhi gayein aur us ki leed aur peshaab tak nekiyon mein likha gaya. Aur jab wo apni lambi rassi tor kar aik do teelon par charh jata hai to us ke qadmon aur us ki leed ki ginti ke muwafiq nekiyan likhi jati hain. Aur jab us ka maalik kisi nadi par se guzray aur wo ghora us mein se pani pee leta hai agarchay maalik ka pilanay ka irada bhi na tha, tab bhi us ke liye un qat-ron ke muwafiq nekiyan likhi jati hain jo us ne piye hain. Ye sawab to be irada pani pee lenay mein hai phir jab pani pilanay ke iraday se le jaye to kya kuch sawab na paye ga. Phir arz ki ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Gad-hay ka haal bayan farmaiye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke gadhon ke baaray mein mere upar koi hukm nahi utra siwae us aayat ke jo be misl aur jama karnay wali hai ke: Jis ne zarra ke barabar neki ki wo usay, qayamat ke din, dekh le ga aur jis ne zarra barabar badi ki wo bhi usay dekh le ga. (Muslim). (Butiha se murad aundha litana hai; qaa qarqar se murad hamwaar zameen hai; aqsa se murad terhay seeng wali hai; niwa se murad dushmani hai; tawal se murad lambi rassi hai; istannat se murad daurna hai; jamia se murad har khair ko shamil hai.)"
"508","[AI-translation] Ahnaf bin Qais kehtay hain ke main Quraish ke chand logon ke saath baitha hua tha ke Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur kehnay lagay ke bisharat do khazana jama karnay walon ko aisay daaghon ki jo un ki peethon par lagaye jayein ge aur un ki karwaton se nikal jayein ge. Aur un ki gudiyon mein lagaye jayein ge to un ki peshaniyon se nikal aayein ge. Phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) aik taraf ho kar baith gaye. Main ne logon se poocha ke ye kaun hain? Logon ne kaha ke Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) hain. Main un ki taraf khara hua aur kaha ke ye kya tha jo main ne abhi abhi suna ke Aap keh rahay thay? Unhon ne kaha ke main wohi keh raha tha jo main ne un ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna. Phir main ne kaha ke Aap is ataa ke baaray mein, yani jo maal-e-ghaneemat se umara Musalmanon ko diya kartay hain, kya kehtay hain? Unhon ne kaha ke tum us ko letay raho ke us mein zarooratein poori hoti hain. Phir jab ye tumharay deen ki qeemat ho jaye tab chhor dena, yani denay walay tum se mudahinat fid-deen chahein to na lena. (Muslim)"
"509","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Dehaat ke chand log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khidmat mein aaye aur arz kiya ke baaz tehseeldaar, zakaat wasool karnay walay, hamaray paas aatay hain aur ham par ziyadati kartay hain. Yani janwar achay se acha letay hain halanke mutawassit lena chahiye. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne tehseeldaaron ko raazi kar diya karo, yani agarchay wo tum par ziyadati bhi karein. Jarir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab se main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye suna tab se koi tehseeldaar mere paas se nahi gaya magar khush ho kar. (Muslim)"
"510","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Aufa (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jab koi qaum sadqa laati thi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke liye farmatay thay ke Ae Allah! Un par rehmat farma. Phir mere walid Abu Aufa (raziyallahu anhu) sadqa le kar aaye to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Allah! Abu Aufa ki aal par rehmat farma. (Muslim)"
"511","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kuch maal baanta to main ne arz kiya ye Ae Allah ke Rasool! Falan ko dijiye ke wo momin hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ya wo Musalman hai. Main ne teen baar yehi kaha ke wo momin hai aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne har baar yehi farmaya ke: Ya Musalman hai. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main aik shakhs ko deta hun halanke doosray ko us se zyada chahta hun us darr se, us shakhs ko deta hun, ke kahin Allah Taala us ko aundhay munh jahannam mein na gira de. (Muslim)"
"512","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hunain ka din hua to, qabeela, Hawazin aur Ghatfan aur doosray qabeelon ke log apni aulad aur janwaron ko le kar aaye aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath das hazaar ghazi thay aur Makka ke log, jo Fatah Makka ke mauqa par Musalman hue thay, bhi, jin ko tulaqa kehtay hain. Phir ye sab aik baar peeth de gaye yahan tak ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) akelay reh gaye. Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke us din Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do aawazein dein ke un ke beech mein kuch nahi kaha, pehle daayein taraf munh kiya aur pukara ke Ae giroh-e-Ansaar! To Ansaar ne jawab diya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham haazir hain aur Aap khush hon ke ham Aap ke saath hain. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne baayein taraf munh kiya aur pukara ke Ae giroh-e-Ansaar! To unhon ne phir jawab diya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham haazir hain aur Aap khush hon ke ham Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath hain. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us din aik safed khachar par sawaar thay, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) utray aur farmaya ke main Allah ka banda hun, maqam-e-bandagi se barh kar koi fakhr ka maqam nahi, aur Rasool hun. Pas mushrik shikast kha gaye. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bohat zyada maal-e-ghaneemat haath aaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sab Muhajireen aur Makka ke logon mein taqseem kar diya aur Ansaar ko us mein se kuch na diya. Tab Ansaar ne kaha ke mushkil ghari mein to ham bulaye jatay hain aur loot ka maal auron ko diya jata hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye khabar hui to Aap ne unhein aik khema mein ikattha kiya aur farmaya ke Ae giroh-e-Ansaar! Ye kaisi baat hai jo mujhe tum logon se pahunchi hai? Tab wo chup ho rahay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae giroh-e-Ansaar! Kya tum us baat par khush nahi hotay ke log duniya le kar chalay jayein aur tum Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apne gharon mein le jao? Unhon ne kaha ke beshak Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham raazi ho gaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar log aik ghaati mein chalein aur Ansaar doosri ghaati mein to main Ansaar ki ghaati ki raah lun ga. Hisham, Anas ke shagird, ne kaha ke main ne kaha ke Ae Abu Hamza! Tum us waqt haazir thay? To unhon ne kaha ke main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko chhor kar kahan jata? (Muslim). (Asal mein yaruddaha tha, haashiye par yuraddiduha hai jo Muslim ke muwafiq hai.)"
"513","[AI-translation] Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Sufyan, Safwan, Uyaina aur Aqra bin Habis ko sau sau oont diye aur Abbas, Abbas bin Mirdas, (raziyallahu anhu) ko kuch kam diye to Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) ne ye ashaar kahay: Tarjuma: Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mera aur mere ghoray ka hissa jis ka naam Ubaid tha Uyaina aur Aqra ke beech mein muqarrar farmatay hain halanke Uyaina aur Aqra donon Mirdas se, yani mujh se, kisi majma mein barh nahi saktay aur main un donon se kuch kam nahi hun. Aur aaj jis ki baat neechay ho gayi wo phir upar na ho gi. Rafi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke sau oont pooray kar diye. (Muslim)"
"514","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Yaman se kuch sona aik chamray mein rakh kar bheja jo babool ki chhaal se ranga hua tha aur abhi, wo sona, mitti se juda nahi kiya gaya tha. Usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaar aadmiyon mein taqseem kar diya, Uyaina bin Hisn, Aqra bin Habis, Zaid, urf, Khail aur chautha Alqama ya Amir bin Tufail (raziyallahu anhuma). Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se kisi shakhs ne kaha ke ham us maal ke un se zyada mustahiq hain. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye khabar pahunchi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum mujhe amantdaar nahi samajhtay? Halanke main us ka amantdaar hun jo aasmanon ke upar hai aur mere paas aasmaan ki khabar subah o shaam aati hai. Phir kehtay hain ke aik shakhs jis ki aankhein dhansi hui thin, jis ke rukhsaron ki haddiyan ubhri hui thin, ubhri hui peshani, ghani daarhi, sar munda hua, oonchi azaar baandhay hue tha, khara hua aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah se daro. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab diya ke teri kharabi ho, kya main saari zameen walon mein sab se zyada Allah se darnay wala nahi hun? Rawi kehtay hain ke phir wo shakhs chala gaya. Khalid bin Waleed (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya main us ki gardan na ura dun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi shayad wo namaz padhta ho. Maloom hua ke wo aksar haazir baash khidmat-e-mubarak bhi na tha warna aisi harkat sarzad na hoti. Khalid (raziyallahu anhu) bolay ke bohat se namazi aisay, munafiq hotay hain, hain jo zubaan se wo baat kehtay hain jo un ke dil mein nahi hoti. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne mujhe ye hukm nahi diya ke main kisi ka dil cheer kar dekhun aur na ye, hukm diya, ke main un ke pait cheerun. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha jab ke wo peeth moray ja raha tha, aur kaha ke us shakhs ki nasal se aisay log niklein ge jo Quran ko achi tarah padhein ge halanke wo un ke galon se neechay nahi utray ga, wo log deen se aisay kharij ho jayein ge jaisay ke teer shikaar, ke jism, se paar nikal jata hai. Rawi kehta hai: Main gumaan karta hun ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye bhi kaha ke agar main us qaum ko paa lun to main unhein qaum-e-Samood ki tarah qatal kar dun. (Muslim)"
"515","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hasan bin Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne aik sadqa ki khajoor lekar apne munh mein daali to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Thoo, thoo! Us ko phaink de kya tu nahi janta ke hamaray liye sadqa halaal nahi hai. (Muslim)"
"516","[AI-translation] Abdul Muttalib bin Rabia bin Haris kehtay hain ke Rabia (raziyallahu anhu) bin Haris aur Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) bin Abdul Muttalib donon jama hue aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham in donon larkon, yani mujhe aur Fazl bin Abbas, ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas bhej dein, aur ye donon ja kar arz karein ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ko zakaat par tehseeldaar bana dein. Aur ye donon Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko la kar ada kar dein jaisay aur log ada kartay hain aur un ko kuch mil jaye jaisay aur logon ko milta hai. Gharz ye guftagu ho rahi thi ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) bin Abu Talib bhi aa kar un ke paas kharay ho gaye to un donon ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se us ka zikr kiya. Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke unhein mat bhejo, ke Allah ki qasam! Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aisa nahi karein ge. Is liye ke Aap ko maloom tha ke zakaat Sayyidon ko haraam hai. Pas Rabia bin Haris Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko bura kehnay lagay aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam tum hamaray saath hasad se aisa kartay ho. Aur Allah ki qasam ke tum ne jo sharf Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki damadi ka paya hai to us ka ham to tum se kuch hasad nahi kartay. Tab Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke acha in donon ko bhej do. To ham donon gaye aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) lait rahay. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zohar ki namaz padh chukay to ham donon jaldi se hujray mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se pehle ja pahunchay aur hujray ke paas kharay ho gaye yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laaye aur ham donon ke kaan pakray, ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki shafqat aur mulaibat thi ke larkay us se khush hotay hain, aur farmaya ke zaahir karo jo tum dil mein chhupa kar laaye ho. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhi hujray mein gaye aur ham bhi, aur us din Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zainab (raziyallahu anha) ke paas thay. Phir aik doosray se kehnay lagay ke tum bayan karo. Gharz aik ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap sab se zyada sila rehmi karnay walay aur qarabat daaron se sab se zyada ehsaan karnay walay hain, aur ham nikah, ki umar, ko pahunch gaye hain. Phir ham is liye haazir hue hain ke Aap hamein un zakaaton par aamil bana dein ke ham bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko tehseel la dein jaisay aur log laatay hain aur hamein bhi kuch mil jaye jaisay auron ko mil jata hai. Taake hamaray nikah ka kharch nikal aaye. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bari dair tak chup ho rahay yahan tak ke ham ne chaha ke phir kuch kahein, aur Zainab (raziyallahu anha) ham se parda ki aar se ishara farmati thin ke ab kuch na kaho. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke zakaat Aal-e-Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke laiq nahi ye to logon ka mail hai. Shayad ye masal yehein se hai ke rupiya paisa haathon ki mail hai. Tum mere paas Mihmiya (raziyallahu anhu), ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke khazanchi ka naam tha, jo khums par muqarrar thay aur Naufal bin Haris bin Abdul Muttalib ko bula lao. Rawi ne kaha ke phir ye donon haazir hue aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Mihmiya (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke tum apni larki us larkay Fazl bin Abbas ko biyah do to unhon ne apni larki un se biyah di. Aur Naufal bin Haris se farmaya ke tum apni larki us larkay, yani Abdul Muttalib bin Rabia se, jo rawi-e-hadees hain, biyah do to unhon ne apni larki mere nikah mein de di. Aur Mihmiya se farmaya ke in donon ka mahar khums se itna itna ada kar do. Zuhri ne kaha ke mujh se mere shaikh Abdullah bin Abdullah ne mahar ki taadaad bayan nahi ki. (Muslim). (Intahaahu se murad khainchna hai; nafasa se murad hasad hai.)"
"517","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Buraira (raziyallahu anha) ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kuch gosht hadiya diya jo ke us ko kisi ne sadqa mein diya tha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne le liya aur farmaya ke un ke liye sadqa hai aur hamaray liye hadiya hai. (Muslim)"
"518","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe sadqa ki aik bakri bheji to main ne us mein se thora gosht Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ko bhej diya. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas tashreef laaye aur farmaya ke tumharay paas kuch khana hai? Unhon ne kaha ke nahi magar Naseeba, yani Umm Atiyya, ne hamaray paas us bakri mein se gosht bheja hai jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke paas bataur sadqa ke bheji thi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo apni jagah pahunch gayi. Yani un ke liye sadqa tha ab hamaray liye hadiya hai. (Muslim)"
"519","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jab khana aata to pooch letay, agar hadiya hota to khatay aur agar sadqa hota to na khatay. (Muslim)"
